      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقِيسٌ</span></b>  pass. part. n. of 1. You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ مَقِيسٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span>, meaning, <i>He,</i> or <i>it, is a person,</i> or
<i>thing, whereby others are measured; to which
others are compared; an object of imitation; a
model, an exemplar,</i> or <i>a standard</i>]. (A, TA.)
